{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45393","headline":"花石长枕歌荅章居士赠 · 皎然","name":"花石长枕歌荅章居士赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚山有石郢人琢，琢成长枕知是玉。\n全疑冰片坐恐销，间发花藂惊不足。\n赠予比之金琅玕，琼花烂熳浮席端。\n吾师道吾不执宝，今日感君因执看。\n试叩铿然应清律，纤尘不留蝇敢拂。\n万物皆因造化资，如何独负清贞质。\n南山有云鹄在空，长松爲我生凉风。\n高友朗咏乐其中，行住四仪皆道意。\n不学小乘一曲士，唯将此物安座隅，取次闲眠有禅味。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45393.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45393","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}